  "description": "Seong-Ha is loved by men and women of all ages for his mature and kind character. But he has scars that can’t be shown to just anyone... U-Ju is the only friend he can open up to. The day after the final exam, Seong-Hagathers the courage to overcome his wounds and try to change. This is the story of Seong-Ha and U-Ju healing each other.\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated) \n\n*Note: Part of Kidari Entertainment's \"Yeoreumdanpyeonseon: Some in Summer (~키다리이엔티 여름단편선~ 썸인썸머, Kidari Entertainment Summer Short Story Collection: Some in Summer)\"*",
